    'Frequently asked questions',
    '<b>Monthly or 3-month injection — which should I choose?</b><br>If regular periods matter most and monthly visits are not a problem, the monthly injection may suit you better. If you want as few clinic visits as possible, the 3-month injection is more convenient. Talk to a doctor to choose what is best for you.',
